      <dt class="font-semibold">Image Based Install (IBI) Operator</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>When you deploy managed clusters, the IBI Operator creates a configuration ISO from the site-specific resources you define in the hub cluster, and attaches the configuration ISO to the preinstalled host by using a bare-metal provisioning service.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>openshift-install</code> program</dt>
